<div class="tool-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">ENCODE & VERIFY</span><h1>Hash generator</h1><p>Generate a deterministic digest from UTF-8 text.</p></div><span class="badge-soft">Server-side · In memory</span></div>
<div class="tool-card">
    <div class="card-toolbar"><label for="hash-algorithm">Algorithm</label><select id="hash-algorithm" class="form-select form-select-sm"><optgroup label="SHA-2"><option value="SHA256">SHA-256</option><option value="SHA384">SHA-384</option><option value="SHA512">SHA-512</option></optgroup><optgroup label="SHA-3"><option value="SHA3-256">SHA3-256</option><option value="SHA3-384">SHA3-384</option><option value="SHA3-512">SHA3-512</option></optgroup><optgroup label="BLAKE2"><option value="BLAKE2B-256">BLAKE2b-256</option><option value="BLAKE2B-512">BLAKE2b-512</option><option value="BLAKE2S-256">BLAKE2s-256</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Keyed HMAC"><option value="HMACSHA256">HMAC-SHA256</option><option value="HMACSHA384">HMAC-SHA384</option><option value="HMACSHA512">HMAC-SHA512</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Legacy compatibility"><option value="SHA1">SHA-1 (legacy)</option><option value="MD5">MD5 (legacy)</option></optgroup></select></div>
    <label class="field-label" for="hash-input">Input</label>
    <textarea id="hash-input" class="form-control code-input" placeholder="Type or paste text here…"></textarea>
    <div id="hash-key-field" class="d-none"><label class="field-label" for="hash-key">Secret key</label><input id="hash-key" class="form-control" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Enter the HMAC secret key" /></div>
    <div class="action-row"><span id="hash-count" class="text-muted">0 characters</span><div><button class="btn btn-ghost clear-btn" data-target="hash-input">Clear</button><button id="hash-run" class="btn btn-primary">Generate hash</button></div></div>
</div>
<div id="hash-result-card" class="tool-card result-card d-none"><div class="result-title"><span>Result</span><button class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost copy-btn" data-target="hash-output">Copy</button></div><code id="hash-output" class="hash-output"></code></div>
